[
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:0:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}我刚刚才见到他们。\n妹妹伊丽莎白、弟弟迪奥多，\n以及他们的客人和客人的朋友们。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}看来他们也被“召唤”\n到了这个世界。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:0:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}不过，他们来自与我们\n不同的地点、不同的时间……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}咦，等等，信息量太大了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}由我来说明吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}我是桐条美鹤。\n我们是月光馆学园的学生……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:2:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F1 25}桐条美鹤\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}也是特别课外活动部……“Ｓ．Ｅ．Ｅ．Ｓ”\n的成员，作为人格面具使，\n以歼灭阴影为目的展开活动。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}歼灭……阴影……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}原来除了我们之外，\n还有别的人格面具使啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0E 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}我们也是刚从玛格丽特小姐那里\n听说了情况，坦白说，\n现在还有些混乱……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}你们……\n似乎并不知道“影时间”。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}影……时间？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}果然如此……以后慢慢说吧。\n看来我们有的是时间。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}虽然不明之处很多，但总之，\n我们现在被困在了这里……\n和你们一样。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 09 01 11 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}同样被困在这里……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}难道把人格面具使聚集起来，\n是有什么原因……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}他是我们的现场队长。\n{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……他是２年级学生。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 01}拥有能自由召唤并运用\n多个人格面具的\n“不羁”之力。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 14 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不羁！？\n和搭档一样啊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 05 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 15 01}两位不羁之力的持有者……\n这就是“加护”的原因吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 03 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 16 01}请多关照。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}彼此彼此{F5 47 02 01 02 01 07 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:13:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}我不会输给你的{F5 47 02 01 02 01 07 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 17 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……你指什么？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 18 01}趁这个机会，\n我们就先做完自我介绍吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:15:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 19 01}嗯……先从３年级开始。\n３年级除了我以外，还有两人。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1A 01}我是真田明彦。\n担任拳击部的主将。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0F 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1B 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}唔……帅哥有小熊一个\n就够了嘛……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 05 01 04 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1C 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}真、真田学长。\n再多说点什么吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1D 01}嗯，是吗……\n我想想………\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:19:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1E 01}我喜欢蛋白粉！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1F 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}……呃。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 11 01 02 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 20 01}这里好像没有呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 13 01 03 01 05 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}我是荒垣真次郎。\n高３……姑且算是吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0222",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 22 01}虽然正在休学，不过有些缘故，\n只恢复了活动部的活动。\n……多关照。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 23 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}什么……缘故？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:25:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 24 01}……有必要当众宣布吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:26:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_025",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0B 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 25 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}真、真够酷的！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:27:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_026",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 26 01}那接下来是高２组了。\n我是岳羽由加莉。\n嗯，是弓道部的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:27:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_026",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}岳羽由加莉\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 27 01}嗯，还有什么能说的……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:28:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_027",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 05 01 03 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 28 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}是学校的偶像哦～。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:29:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_028",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 01 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 29 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}喂，别乱说！\n你是笨蛋吗。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:30:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_029",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0B 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0A 01 09 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2A 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}哪里哪里，在小熊心中的偶像排行榜上，\n你可是直线上升哦，嘿嘿嘿。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:31:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_030",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2B 01}话说，原来你\n是只熊啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:32:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_031",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2C 01}小熊就是熊熊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:32:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_031",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2D 01}而且，小熊要是大胆地\n脱下这身可爱的熊皮……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:33:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_032",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2E 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}就会从里面蹦出\n一位时髦又惹人怜爱的美少年熊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:34:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_033",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2F 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}啊，好，谢谢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:35:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_034",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0C 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 30 01}那接下来轮到我啦。\n我是伊织顺平，\n无比热爱和平的英雄！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:36:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_035",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 31 01}……你家该不会开着JUNES，\n不对，某家百货店吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:37:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_036",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 09 01 03 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 32 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}那不是我吗！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:38:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_037",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 33 01}那个，接下来……是我吧？\n我、我是山岸风花。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:38:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_037",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F1 25}山岸风花\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 34 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}嗯，和大家不同，\n我的能力属于后援型……\n还有，那个……请多关照！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:39:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_038",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 35 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}后援！？\n那就和我一样！\n我们多聊聊吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:40:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_039",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 36 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}咦？\n啊，好、好的！\n请多关照！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:41:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_040",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 10 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 37 01}我在月光馆学园\n也属于２年级。\n我是埃癸斯。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:41:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_040",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}埃癸斯\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 38 01}陪伴在{F5 C1 0B 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}身边，\n对我而言非常重要。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:42:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_041",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 39 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}你、你们该不会在交往吧！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:43:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_042",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 05 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3A 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}团队内部谈恋爱，\n居然是公开的！？\n气氛不会变得奇怪吗！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:44:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_043",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3B 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}比起这个，似乎还有\n更值得追问的地方……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:45:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_044",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3C 01}接下来是我。\n我是天田乾。\n乾写作干燥的乾，读作Ken。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:45:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_044",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F1 25}天田乾\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3D 01}我和大家不同，不是高中生，\n而是月光馆学园小学部的５年级学生。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:46:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_045",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3E 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}小学５年级……？\n咦，才１０岁啊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:47:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_046",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 05 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3F 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}十、１１岁了！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:48:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_047",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 40 01}不都差不多吗。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:49:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_048",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 41 01}差１岁可是差很多呢。　对吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:50:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_049",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 09 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 42 01}嗯……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:51:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_050",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 12 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 43 01}汪！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:52:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_051",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 44 01}这位是虎狼丸。\n终于轮到他压轴做自我介绍，\n他现在干劲十足。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:53:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_052",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 45 01}叫虎狼丸啊～。\n过来～！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:54:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_053",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 12 01 03 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 07 01 05 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 46 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}哇，毛茸茸的！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:55:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_054",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 47 01}喂……让我摸摸。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:56:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_055",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 12 01 05 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 48 01}嗷！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:57:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_056",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 49 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}咦，等一下……这小狗也是？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:58:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_057",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 12 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4A 01}是人格面具使。\n它的主人去世了，\n现在和我们一起生活。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:59:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_058",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4B 01}这样啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:59:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_058",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4C 01}……乖，乖。\n你也很努力呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:60:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_059",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4D 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}汪。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:61:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_060",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4E 01}我们就这些人了。\n也能说说你们的情况吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:62:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_061",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞自己这边也依次\n　进行了自我介绍……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:62:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_061",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞善和玲也介绍了名字，\n　并说明自己在这里待了很久、\n　失去了记忆等情况……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:63:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_062",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 86 29 01 01 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4F 01}请、请多多关照……是的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:64:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_063",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 50 01}我们来共享一下情报吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:64:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_063",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 51 01}无论我们还是各位，\n都因为不明的原因，\n被困在了这里。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:64:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_063",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 52 01}在迷宫中遇到的善和玲……\n他们也被困在这里，\n而且失去了记忆。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:65:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_064",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 53 01}嗯，没错。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:66:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_065",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0B 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 54 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}咦，那该不会……\n要是我们一直出不去，\n也会失去记忆……吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:67:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0652",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0F 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 55 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}哈哈，怎么可能嘛！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:68:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0653",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 56 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}……不会吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:69:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_066",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 04 01 01 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 57 01}……目前还真没法否定。\n他们俩的记忆好像就是被谁夺走的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:70:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0662",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 58 01}总之，大家要不要一起行动？\n目标都是离开这里嘛。\n是吧，搭档？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:71:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK067",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}就这么办{F5 47 02 01 02 01 03 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:71:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK067",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}看他们的意思{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:71:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK067",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}我刚想这么说！{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:72:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_068",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 59 01}哈哈，抱歉抱歉。\n这么说，咱们想的\n都是一样的嘛。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:73:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_069",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0E 01 0B 01 02 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5A 01}我们也有不少想问的事。\n我赞成……\n你觉得呢，{F5 C1 0A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:74:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_070",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5B 01}当然，一起行动吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:75:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_071",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 02 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 86 04 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5C 01}那就这么定了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:76:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_072",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 05 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5D 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}好厉害，同伴一下子翻倍了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:77:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_073",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 05 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5E 01}还有天田、小虎这样\n不是高中生的伙伴，真有意思呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:78:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_074",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 09 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5F 01}真是的，我们这边\n不是也有小熊嘛。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:79:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_075",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 60 01}啊，你也在啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:80:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_076",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 08 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 61 01}{F5 C1 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}太过分了！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:81:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_077",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 62 01}他们……真的是同伴吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:82:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_078",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 63 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}有、有点紧张呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:83:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_079",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 23 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 64 01}各位差不多聊完了吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:83:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_079",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 65 01}……我可一直在等着呢。\n一直。等了很久。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:84:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_080",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0C 01 07 01 03 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 66 01}你们那位蓝衣服的，是这种性格啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:85:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_081",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 67 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}还挺居高临下的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:86:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_082",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 09 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 68 01}我们这边总觉得……不太妙啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:87:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_083",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0B 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 69 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}不太妙？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:88:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_084",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6A 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}你很快就知道了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:89:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_085",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 22 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 23 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6B 01}看来这座迷宫里没有出口？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:90:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_086",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6C 01}是的。　连影子都没有。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:91:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_087",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6D 01}果然，出口应该就是\n天鹅绒房间里的那两扇门。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:92:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_088",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6E 01}就是“挂着４把锁的门”吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:93:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_089",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6F 01}嗯。\n正如刚才托人转告的那样，\n其中１把锁似乎马上就要打开了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:94:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_090",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 70 01}那还剩“３把”……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:95:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_091",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 71 01}根据善的记忆，\n迷宫也还剩３座……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:95:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_091",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 72 01}目前可以暂且认为二者是对应的，\n开始寻找下一座迷宫。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:96:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_092",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 73 01}还有３座，好多啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:97:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_093",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 74 01}才３座而已。\n真没劲。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_300.bf.json:98:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_094",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 75 01}既然来日方长，就需要再多些帮助了。\n正好妹妹他们也到了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
